Package: jaspRoboReport
Type: Package
Title: JASP RoboReport
Version: 0.1.0
Date: 2026-07-17
Authors@R: person("JASP Team", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Author: JASP Team
Maintainer: JASP Team <info@jasp-stats.org>
Description: Deterministic R scripting layer for generating annotated
    reports via the JASP JSON-RPC toolset. Provides ergonomic wrappers
    around the JASP RPC methods (analysis_run, analysis_results,
    analysis_createAnnotation, write_report, etc.) and a report
    composition DSL for interleaving prose with references to existing
    JASP result elements.
License: GPL2+
Encoding: UTF-8
LazyData: true
Imports:
    httr2,
    jsonlite,
    glue
